<p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">SCP-5418 is to be held in the standard humanoid containment chamber. Scranton Reality Anchor device is to be placed within the cell away from the subject’s reach, and three armed guards are to be established outside of the entry point at all time. Only personnel with proper level 4 credential are prohibited from entering the subject’s containment chamber.</span></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Updated&nbsp;Special&nbsp;Containment&nbsp;Procedure</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Updated&nbsp;Special&nbsp;Containment&nbsp;Procedure</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>SCP-5418 is to remain in its designated location. The area is an underground chamber, underneath Altai Tavan Bogd Mountain, the activity towards the Mountains is to be restricted under the guise of Military operation by the Mongolian government. No personnel without a proper security clearance are prohibited from entering the confined area. The underground chamber is to be strictly monitored 24/7 for SCP-5418's activity. The area's perimeter is surrounded by an SRA device to prevent Reality distortion from leaking through the mass populace. Motion censoring device is placed within The underground chamber to locate the subject’s movement if something happens to the anomaly.</p>
<p>No more than five personnel wearing hazmat suits are to enter the fixed location simultaneously to verify the subject's state. Individuals who entered the area interact and talk to the subject if it ever resurfaced and should not stay longer than three days, at the assigned location.</p>
<p>If the subject is seen leaving its location, the entity should be immediately apprehended and questioned. If SCP-5418 refused to cooperate, they must return the entity to its previous containment chamber and wait for further instruction.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5418 is a seventeen-year-old male humanoid of Mongolian descent. SCP-5418 introduces itself as Oulen. The entity posses low telekinesis ability and is Type green reality-bender.</p>
<p>SCP-5418 can control a large source of carbon-based compounds found within a natural, terrestrial and aquatic environments. It favours mainly natural segments to distort, restructure and assemble a new reality for its benefit. The entity detests implementing its ability on innocent civilians; however, the subject will go into a hostile state when provoked. Regardless, SCP-5418 is known to be subtle and easily disturbed. Due to the subject's unpredictable nature, it poses an improbable danger to the mass population.</p>
<p>The entity can tear through the shreds of spatial reality to produce an entrance to an unknown dimension. But as of this date, SCP-5418 had only used its aforementioned ability once. More information on the occurrence of this reality-bending ability is yet to be determined as testing is currently not feasible.</p>
<p><strong>Discovery:</strong> SCP-5418 was found within its apartment, when MTF agents raided the establishment after an extensive investigation of reality distortion reports across Khan Uul district, Mongolia. The subject fled the premises by distorting the dimension of the apartment. Based upon MTF agents' information, the entity changed the residents into the hallway, and the subject ran through it. The agents reported, “feeling of not advancing as if walking on a treadmill” while trying to capture the entity.</p>
<p>Due to the distortion of reality, agents had to use an SRA device to block its anomalous ability; upon activation, the apartment reverted to its previous appearance. The subject presumably knocked unconscious during its attempt to flee the vicinity and was taken into custody without any further incident.</p>
<p>Since its containment, SCP-5418's attempt at gaining control over its power had been thwarted by Dr Fox, and special training has been approved to subdue it.</p>
<p><strong>Addendum 5418.1:</strong> Upon being brought to the site ██, SCP-5418 caused an accidental reality distortion when entering the interview room<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-1')">1</a></sup>. SCP-5418 had been brought back to its containment to be questioned.</p>
